[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4978475604","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121390#issuecomment-4978475604","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121390","id":4978475604,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKL2CVA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T08:25:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T08:25:48Z","body":"This is expected and [documented](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_image.html#class-image-method-set-pixel)\n> Depending on the image's format, the color set here may be clamped or lose precision. Do not assume the color returned by get_pixelv() to be identical to the one set here; any comparisons will likely need to use an approximation like Color.is_equal_approx().","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4978475604/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4980915346","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121390#issuecomment-4980915346","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121390","id":4980915346,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKOK8kg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T13:07:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T13:07:17Z","body":"Closing as this is expected and documented","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4980915346/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4980942096","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121390#issuecomment-4980942096","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121390","id":4980942096,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKOMlEA","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T13:10:01Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T13:10:01Z","body":"You can use a precise format, such as `Image.FORMAT_RGBAF`:\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends EditorScript\n\nfunc _run() -> void:\n    var target_color := Color(0.3198, 0.9311, 0.5963, 0.9209)\n    var image := Image.create(64, 64, false, Image.FORMAT_RGBAF)\n    image.set_pixel(0, 0, target_color)\n    var result_color := image.get_pixel(0, 0)\n    print(target_color == result_color) # true\n    print(target_color.is_equal_approx(result_color)) # true\n```\n\nOr you can use a comparison of the absolute value of the difference between colors with the desired epsilon, instead of `is_equal_approx()`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4980942096/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4981202291","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121390#issuecomment-4981202291","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121390","id":4981202291,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKOcdcw","user":{"login":"Arecher","id":10502115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTAyMTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10502115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher","html_url":"https://github.com/Arecher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T13:37:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T11:46:10Z","body":"The fact that the documentation says to use `is_equal_approx()` but that it is clearly not always enough is a little misleading. Perhaps that note should be expanded to recommend using RGBAF in combination with `is_equal_approx()` when exact matches are desired, or instead recommend a code snippet with a custom epsilon instead.\n\nBecause while subsequent `set_pixel()` and `get_pixel()` calls don't return an exact match, which is a well documented and expected limitation, the same cannot be said for  `Color.is_equal_approx()` not working consistently. The author clearly read and followed the suggested workaround, and still couldn't accurately compare color values, which is a valid and reasonable issue in my eyes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4981202291/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4985402045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121390#issuecomment-4985402045","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121390","id":4985402045,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKScyvQ","user":{"login":"jeadhz","id":136469511,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCJcBw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136469511?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeadhz","html_url":"https://github.com/jeadhz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeadhz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeadhz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeadhz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeadhz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeadhz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeadhz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeadhz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeadhz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeadhz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T21:24:25Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T21:24:25Z","body":"I appreciate you @dalexeev for letting me know there is a way and I appreciate you @Arecher for acknowledging what I went through **exactly**\n\nI may be uploading a doc change to make sure it is well documented whenever I can get the godot setup going\n\nThank you guys","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4985402045/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]